"],["َىٰ","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MP"]]},{"i":"4:121:3","a":"جَهَنَّمُ","t":"(is) Hell","p":"PN","tr":"jahannamu","f":["NOM"],"l":148},{"i":"4:121:4","a":"وَلَا","t":"and not","p":"NEG","tr":"walā","l":4,"g":[["وَ","REM","prefix","w:REM"],["لَا","NEG","stem",""]]},{"i":"4:121:5","a":"يَجِدُونَ","t":"they will find","p":"V","tr":"yajidūna","f":["IMPF","3MP"],"r":105,"l":106,"g":[["يَجِدُ","V","stem","IMPF|3MP"],["ونَ","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MP"]]},{"i":"4:121:6","a":"عَنْهَا","t":"from it","p":"P","tr":"ʿanhā","l":21,"g":[["عَنْ","P","stem",""],["هَا","PRON","suffix","PRON:3FS"]]},{"i":"4:121:7","a":"مَحِيصًۭا","t":"any escape","p":"N","tr":"maḥīṣan","f":["VN","M","INDEF","ACC"],"r":764,"l":1369},{"e":"١٢١","v":"4:121"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"4:114","t":"No good is there in much of their private conversation, except for those who enjoin charity or that which is right or conciliation between people. And whoever does that seeking means to the approval of Allāh - then We are going to give him a great reward.","j":5,"h":10,"s":4,"a":114,"sd":null},{"k":"4:115","t":"And whoever opposes the Messenger after guidance has become clear to him and follows other than the way of the believers - We will give him what he has taken and drive him into Hell, and evil it is as a destination.","j":5,"h":10,"s":4,"a":115,"sd":null},{"k":"4:116","t":"Indeed, Allāh does not forgive association with Him, but He forgives what is less than that for whom He wills. And he who associates others with Allāh has certainly gone far astray.","j":5,"h":10,"s":4,"a":116,"sd":null},{"k":"4:117","t":"They call upon instead of Him none but female [deities], and they [actually] call upon none but a rebellious Satan,","j":5,"h":10,"s":4,"a":117,"sd":null},{"k":"4:118","t":"Whom Allāh has cursed. For he had said, \"I will surely take from among Your servants a specific portion.","j":5,"h":10,"s":4,"a":118,"sd":null},{"k":"4:119","t":"And I will mislead them, and I will arouse in them [sinful] desires, and I will command them so they will slit the ears of cattle, and I will command them so they will change the creation of Allāh.\" And whoever takes Satan as an ally instead of Allāh has certainly sustained a clear loss.","j":5,"h":10,"s":4,"a":119,"sd":null},{"k":"4:120","t":"He [i.e., Satan] promises them and arouses desire in them. But Satan does not promise them except delusion.","j":5,"h":10,"s":4,"a":120,"sd":null},{"k":"4:121","t":"The refuge of those will be Hell, and they will not find from it an escape.","j":5,"h":10,"s":4,"a":121,"sd":null}],"juz":5,"hizb":10,"surahs":[4],"sajdah":false}